\[
\rho(1+\rho)(x_{v''}-x_{v_0})=\rho(x_{u''}+x_{u'}-x_{u_k}-x_{u_i})> 2x_{v''}+2x_{v''}+x_{v_1}-4x_{v_0}>4(x_{v''}-x_{v_0}),
\]
implying that $x_{v''}>x_{v_0}$, a contradiction.
