& > 2x_{u_k}+3x_{u'}+x_{v_0}+x_{v_1}-2x_{u_i}-x_{u_j}-x_{u_k}-\sum_{u\in N_I(v_1)\setminus\{u_i\}}x_u\\
& >3x_{u'}-2x_{u_i},
\end{align*}
so $(\rho^2(G)+\rho-2)(x_{u'}-x_{u_i})>x_{u'}>0$, as claimed.
