Suppose in the following that $|I|\ge 3$.
Since $G$ is $K_{1,4}$-free and $I$ is an independent set of $G$,
 $d_I(v)\le 3$ for any vertex $v\in K$.





%
%\begin{Claim}\label{K14}
%If for any $v\in K$, $d_I(v)=2$, then $G$ is $K_{1,4}$-free.
%\end{Claim}
