%Then $B_{22}\subset N_G(u_4)$ by Claim \ref{adj} and $u_4\notin N_I(v)$ for any $v\in A_{12}$ by Claim \ref{AABB}.
%%If $|B_{22}|\ge2$, then $G-u_4v_{21}+u_1v_{21}\in \mathbb{G}_n$, and by Lemma \ref{perron} in view of $x_{u_4}\le x_{u_2}\le x_{u_1}$, we have $\rho(G-u_4v_{21}+u_1v_{21})>\rho(G)$, a contradiction, so $|B_{22}|=1$.
