+        "maximum matching in O(n^3), then orients the complementary 2-factor; "
+        "selftest measures its shipping-preset wall time and primitive operations, "
+        "whereas the modular-difference route uses at most 3n=282 exact integer "
+        "operations at n=94 and only adjacency lookups thereafter."
